# Claude Code effort-unlock proxy — configuration
# ============================================================================
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is gitignored.
#
#   API_BASE     : upstream URL. Each pair may have its own (see below).
#   API_KEY      : key sent to upstream.
#   TARGET_MODEL : the real model name the upstream recognises (in body.model).
#   SPOOF_MODEL  : a Claude-whitelisted ID Claude Code sees instead, so that
#                  `/effort max` / `xhigh` pass the client-side detection.
#                  The proxy rewrites body.model back to TARGET_MODEL before
#                  forwarding, so the upstream never sees the spoof value.
#   FORMAT       : upstream wire format — `anthropic` (default, native
#                  /v1/messages passthrough) or `openai` (translates
#                  Anthropic ↔ OpenAI /v1/chat/completions, incl. streaming
#                  SSE + tool calls). Use `openai` for OpenAI-compatible
#                  gateways that don't speak Anthropic natively.
#   CONTEXT_WINDOW    : 真实模型输入上下文窗口（token 数）。proxy 会注入到
#                       API 响应的 modelUsage 中，webview 据此显示正确的使用量。
#                       设为 0 则不注入。编号后缀 _2, _3, … 用于多 pair。
#   MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS : 最大输出 token 数。设为 0 则不注入。
#   PROXY_PORT   : local listen port.
#   PROXY_LOG    : 1 = log each request (default), 0 = silent.
#
# --- Multi-upstream / multi-model (unlimited pairs) -----------------------
# Pair #1 is the unnumbered keys above (always present, the default). Add more
# pairs with numeric suffixes (2, 3, 4, …). Each pair carries its OWN upstream
# (apiBase + apiKey) + spoof���target mapping + format. A numbered pair may omit
# API_BASE_n / API_KEY_n / FORMAT_n, in which case they fall back to pair #1.
# NOTE: unknown models (not any configured SPOOF/TARGET) are rejected with 400
# — pair #1 is NOT a fallback for them.
#
#   API_BASE_2=https://api.siliconflow.cn
#   API_KEY_2=sk-...
#   SPOOF_MODEL_2=claude-sonnet-4-5
#   TARGET_MODEL_2=zai-org/GLM-5.2
#   FORMAT_2=anthropic
#
# Point Claude Code at the spoof ID you want (ANTHROPIC_MODEL=<spoof>); the
# proxy routes to that pair's upstream and converts formats as needed.
# ============================================================================

# --- Pair #1: OpenAI-compatible gateway (e.g. 小米 MiMo) ---
API_BASE=https://api.xiaomimimo.com
API_KEY=your_openai_compatible_key
TARGET_MODEL=mimo-v2.5-pro
SPOOF_MODEL=claude-opus-4-7
FORMAT=openai
# CONTEXT_WINDOW: 真实模型输入上下文窗口（token 数），注入到 webview 用于显示使用量。
# 设为 0 则不注入，webview 使用 CLI 内置的 spoof 模型值（~200K）。
CONTEXT_WINDOW=1048576
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS: 最大输出 token 数。设为 0 则不注入。
MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=131072
PROXY_PORT=8787
PROXY_LOG=1

# --- Pair #2: Anthropic-native gateway (e.g. SiliconFlow GLM-5.2) ---
# API_BASE_2=https://api.siliconflow.cn
# API_KEY_2=your_anthropic_native_key
# SPOOF_MODEL_2=claude-opus-4-8
# TARGET_MODEL_2=zai-org/GLM-5.2
# FORMAT_2=anthropic
# CONTEXT_WINDOW_2=1048576
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS_2=131072

# --- Anthropic official (example of another native endpoint) ---
# API_BASE=https://api.anthropic.com
# API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here
# TARGET_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# SPOOF_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8
# FORMAT=anthropic
# CONTEXT_WINDOW=200000
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=32000
# PROXY_PORT=8787
